The '''Snow Days''' is an annual [[Events|event]] during the months of December throughout January in celebration of the [[wikipedia:Christmas and holiday season|Winter Holidays]]. The event takes place in [[Snowhill]] where the [[The Gifting Tree]] gives presents to all of the residents of Snowhill. The evil snowman [[:Category:Boss|boss]] named the [[Abominable Snowman]] and his [[Snowman|evil snowmen]] try to take all the presents for themselves, and [[Candi Ivy]], who gives you [[Quests|quests]], will up to stop the Abominable Snowman and his evil snowmen.

==Questline==
The Snow Days questline begins in Snowhill.

# The Gifting Tree from Candi Ivy (repeatable once per day)
# Present Problems from Candi Ivy
# Holiday Cheer from Candi Ivy
# Silversnow's Sapling from Candi Ivy
# Guarding the Gifting Tree from Candi Ivy
# The Perfect Disguise from Candi Ivy
# Robgoblin Robbery Ring from Candi Ivy
# Snowmen Disassembly from Candi Ivy
# An Unexpected Gift from Candi Ivy

* Party Animal from Preston Daly next to the [[Sanctuary]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]]
* Snowman Showdown from Everett (continuously repeatable)

These repeatable quests only become available after completing the quest series:
* Bye-Bye Supplies! from Candi Ivy (repeatable once per day)
* Curious Gift Baskets from Downey (repeatable once per day)
* Holiday Recital from [[Mayor Crystalline]] (repeatable once per day)
* Pretty Presents from Annabelle (repeatable once per day)

After you've finished the quest series, you will be able to go back and interfere with the [[Robgoblins]]' snowman building at any time.

==Snowmen Invaders==
To defeat the Abominable Snowman, you must participate in the live minigame in one of the following places that the Abominable Snowman will spawn on Snowhill in every 15 minutes.

There's a game-wide announcement to let you know that snowmen invaders are attacking the Gifting Tree. You should be able to find and grab some snowballs from a pile that you can click on, and help out your friends as you knock these snowmen down. Occasionally, you will receive 1-2 Snowman Coal when you defeat one. The Snowman Coal is used for the repeatable quest Snowman Showdown.

Use the number 3 key on your keyboard to throw at the Abominable Snowman with snowballs. It will take several people working together to take down this menace. After the Abominable Snowman is defeated, a treasure chest will drop, rewarding one random Mystery Gift to everyone that participated.

==Snowball Fights!==
You can scoop up some snowballs and have a snowball fight with your friends! Keep an eye out for Snowball Piles around Snowhill and have fun.

You can also stage an epic snowball fight with other players. Head over near [[Big J]]'s and speak to Calvin Coldcastle to be added to the fight queue.

==12 Days of Holidays==
The Snow Days of holidays offers 12 presents. These presents can be opened on December 25th, 2012. To open a present you need a bow. Bows will be rewarded by doing the daily quests. Each day will have a separate quest that can be started by talking to Trina Turtledove. You can also track the amount of presents and bows you have by talking to her.

If you miss a day, you can still complete the quest but you will not be given a bow, you must then purchase the bow for SC in order to open the present.

You will also receive a "Big Present" for every 4 of the daily presents you can open.

# Day 1: Penguin Defense
# Day 2: Snowball Fight
# Day 3: Crafty Robgoblins
# Day 4: Cookie! Nom Nom!
# Day 5: Wintery Fishing
# Day 6: Defend the Gifting Tree
# Day 7: Snowhill Racing
# Day 8: Nog Hog
# Day 9: Snowhill Soccer
# Day 10: Battle for Snowhill
# Day 11: Snowhill Derby
# Day 12: Abominable Invasion

