==Years of Snow Days==
===2009===
Below is a list of items, quests, etc that were available during the 2009 version of this event, but not in later years.
*Snow Globe Hat, a Limited Edition item
*[[2010 Party Hat]]
*The Snow Days Bonus Wheel was an extra daily wheel that gave out mainly holiday items.

===2010===
Below is a list of items, quests, etc that were available during the 2010 version of this event, but not in later years.
*Gifting Tree
*[[Icy Hoverboard]]
*Snow Days Membership Gift
*[[Snow Globe]], this was available in the December 2011 Member's Pack or possibly from the Gifting Trees
*[[Tacky Sweater Penguin]]
*There's one costume, the [[Penguin Outfit]], that was a [[Super Spooktacular|Spooktacular]] [[Items|item]] in 2009, but was moved to Snow Days beginning in 2010.
*The Tacky Snowman Sweater was available from the TCG scenario Kai's Challenge during 2009. The challenge didn't return, but the sweater is available as a Mystery Gift.
*There were the Winter Community Parties held in 2010, which were attended by [[Tiger the Party Animal]]. He gave out the quest Winter Party.

